# Groundchuck & Dirtbag: "Whenever you tap a land for mana, add {G}." It is a mana ability triggered by a mana ability (CR
# 605.1b): it resolves at once, no stack. Bot1 casts it from Black Lotus and three Moxen (none of them lands, so nothing extra),
# then on turn 3 a Forest taps for {G}{G} while a Mox Ruby, an artifact, adds only its own {R}. Bot2 tapping its own Island on
# turn 4 gives Bot1 nothing: it is "you tap".

